WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.001 --> 00:00:04.512
Carabas was upset.

2
00:00:04.513 --> 00:00:07.350
He wanted to meet Fiona.

3
00:00:07.351 --> 00:00:13.108
But he had no money for new clothes.

4
00:00:13.109 --> 00:00:16.879
"Don't worry, Master," Puss said.

5
00:00:16.880 --> 00:00:19.113
"I have a new plan.

6
00:00:19.114 --> 00:00:22.207
Tomorrow Fiona will take a carriage ride.

7
00:00:22.208 --> 00:00:27.617
She'll be with her father."

8
00:00:27.618 --> 00:00:31.848
"Who is Fiona's father?" Carabas asked.

9
00:00:31.849 --> 00:00:39.483
Puss didn't answer.

10
00:00:39.484 --> 00:00:42.229
Carabas tapped a foot.

11
00:00:42.230 --> 00:00:49.291
"Puss, who is Fiona's father?"

12
00:00:49.292 --> 00:00:57.150
"He's, um, the king," Puss said.

13
00:00:57.151 --> 00:01:00.038
"What?" Carabas cried.

14
00:01:00.039 --> 00:01:03.195
"I can't marry a princess!"

15
00:01:03.196 --> 00:01:07.295
"I told the king you're a rich duke," Puss said.

16
00:01:07.296 --> 00:01:13.233
"A duke?" Carabas gasped. "You lied?"

17
00:01:13.234 --> 00:01:19.023
Puss waved a paw. "It's just a little lie."

18
00:01:19.024 --> 00:01:23.052
"No, it's a big lie!" Carabas said.

19
00:01:23.053 --> 00:01:25.827
"And lying is wrong!"

20
00:01:25.828 --> 00:01:35.706
Puss sighed. "Fine. Forget about Fiona."

21
00:01:35.707 --> 00:01:41.046
Carabas folded his arms. "I will forget her."

22
00:01:41.047 --> 00:01:52.909
But Puss still had a plan—a sneaky plan.

23
00:01:52.910 --> 00:01:56.085
"Let's go swimming," Puss said the next morning.

24
00:01:56.086 --> 00:01:58.866
"We can swim in the river."

25
00:01:58.867 --> 00:02:01.716
"Good idea," Carabas said.

26
00:02:01.717 --> 00:02:07.416
Puss grinned. "I know a nice spot along the road."

27
00:02:07.417 --> 00:02:10.830
Carabas and Puss went to the river.

28
00:02:10.831 --> 00:02:14.424
Carabas took off his ripped clothes.

29
00:02:14.425 --> 00:02:22.922
He dived in. Splash!

30
00:02:22.923 --> 00:02:27.130
The king and Fiona were riding in their carriage.

31
00:02:27.131 --> 00:02:30.961
Fiona played her guitar.

32
00:02:30.962 --> 00:02:36.072
Suddenly she stopped. "There's Puss!"

33
00:02:36.073 --> 00:02:39.256
Puss ran toward the carriage.

34
00:02:39.257 --> 00:02:41.835
"Help!" he shouted.

35
00:02:41.836 --> 00:02:47.722
"The Duke of Carabas is drowning!"

